  {
    "title": "Drift repair includes an ownership decision",
    "kind": "ownership",
    "description": "The lab intentionally uses force-conflicts for this disposable field, restoring the source value and ownership contract.",
    "assumption": "The drift exercise uses an ordinary patch; conflicting SSA by a second manager is a separate API operation.",
